WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.470
Cash on delivery: cash collected on delivery and paid in.

2
00:00:06.019 --> 00:00:08.360
Look at the "Not collected" payments.

3
00:00:08.913 --> 00:00:12.460
When the courier has the cash, click "Collected".

4
00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:19.690
When the money reaches your account, record "Paid in"; the COD limit is in "Payment settings".

5
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:26.110
Keep the gap between collected and paid in short; cash goes missing in transit.
